      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's generally recommended to consult with your doctor before continuing or changing any supplements, especially when taking medications. Warfarin (Coumadin) and vitamin K interact with each other, as vitamin K can help counteract the blood-thinning effects of warfarin. Your doctor can help determine the right balance for your specific situation and monitor your health closely. They may recommend alternative supplements or adjust the dose of warfarin as needed.",
